      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "RUNWARE SCRIPT DIRECTOR — whole script → 60-70 photoreal images\n\n1. Put your Runware key in 'Runware API Key' (or leave it empty and save it\n   in custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Runware-ScriptDirector/runware_api_key.txt).\n2. Paste the whole script into node 1, set the title and the image range.\n3. Review first (recommended): select node 5 and press Ctrl+B to bypass it,\n   then Run. Read the scenes, bible, plan and prompts on each node.\n4. Press Ctrl+B again on node 5 and Run: only the images are made; the\n   text steps are reused from the cache.\n5. Images: ComfyUI/output/<output_folder>/scene_001.jpg … + scenes.csv.\n\nRedo single images: type e.g. 4, 9-11 in node 5 → only_scenes.\nChange a prompt: node 4 → prompt_overrides, e.g.  12: Create a photo…\nFix a character's look: copy node 2's text into bible_override and edit.\n\nModels: Claude Opus 5.5 (text + photo check, auto-fallback to Sonnet 5)\nand FLUX.2 [max] (images, true 9:16) — all on your Runware key."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "RUNWARE SCRIPT DIRECTOR — whole script → 60-70 photoreal images\n\n1. Put your Runware key in 'Runware API Key' (or leave it empty and save it\n   in custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Runware-ScriptDirector/runware_api_key.txt).\n2. Paste the whole script into node 1, set the title and the image range.\n3. Review first (recommended): select node 5 and press Ctrl+B to bypass it,\n   then Run. Read the scenes, bible, plan and prompts on each node.\n4. Press Ctrl+B again on node 5 and Run: only the images are made; the\n   text steps are reused from the cache.\n5. Images: ComfyUI/output/<output_folder>/scene_001.jpg … + scenes.csv.\n\nRedo single images: type e.g. 4, 9-11 in node 5 → only_scenes.\nChange a prompt: node 4 → prompt_overrides, e.g.  12: Create a photo…\nFix a character's look: copy node 2's text into bible_override and edit.\n\nModels: Claude Opus 5.5 (text + photo check, auto-fallback to Sonnet 5)\nand FLUX.2 [max] (images, true 9:16) — all on your Runware key."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
